  "explanation": "The supply of 200 MT of structural steel tubes, grade YSt 240 and diameter 50 NB for the pipe truss of an industrial shed, is governed by IS 1161:2014, which covers the specification for steel tubes for structural purposes. The allied standards IS 1387:1993, IS 228 (Part 1):2025, IS 2328:2018, IS 4711:2008, IS 4736:1986, and IS 4740:1979 are cited to supplement the technical requirements of the primary standard. Note that IS 1161:2014 carries 2 amendment(s), the latest being Second Amendment of 2023.",
